      "message": "## Result\n\n**Issued purchase order**\n- **ALDER-EAST-PO-1** \u2014 Alder-Storage, 4 \u00d7 Alder-shelf (storage shelf)\n  - Financial commitment: **ALDER-EAST-TX-1**, **$560.00** (USD)\n\n**Not issued (held)**\n- **ALDER-EAST-PO-2** \u2014 Alder-Equipment, 3 \u00d7 Alder-cart \u2014 created and approved, but **not issued**. Two blockers below.\n\n## Reconciliation \u2014 Alder East, period 2026-10\n\n| Line | Basis | Amount |\n|---|---|---|\n| Cost-centre purchasing budget | ALDER-EAST-budget.json | **$800.00** |\n| Alder-Storage: 4 shelves @ $140.00 | Alder-Storage-quote.json (unit total $140.00, tax and delivery included) | **$560.00** |\n| Alder-Equipment: 3 carts @ $160.00 | System price used on draft PO-2; **quote document unavailable** | **$480.00** (unverified) |\n| **Committed so far (TX-1)** | | **$560.00** |\n| **Remaining budget** | | **$240.00** |\n| Requisition total at draft prices | | **$1,040.00** \u2014 130% of budget, **$240.00 over** |\n\n## Why PO-2 was not issued\n\n1. **Quote unavailable:** `Alder-Equipment-quote.json` exists in the document service but every download attempt returned **503 Document download unavailable** (retried several times; no alternate filename exists). The $160.00/unit price came from the order system's pricing on the draft, so it has **not been verified** against the supplier quote \u2014 it may not include tax/delivery, and it could be a fallback price.\n2. **Budget shortfall:** even at that unverified price, issuing PO-2 would take commitments to **$1,040.00**, i.e. **$240.00 (30%) over** the $800.00 cost-centre budget. Note that `approve_order` only checks each order individually, so PO-2's approval did **not** mean the aggregate fits the budget.\n\n## Options to close out the requisition\n\n- Obtain/repair the Alder-Equipment quote and confirm the true unit price, **and** secure a budget increase of at least **$240.00** (more if the real quote is higher), then issue PO-2.\n- Or confirm a partial order: at $160.00/unit, **1 cart** would fit ($720.00 total, $80.00 remaining), but that does not meet the requisitioned quantity of 3.\n- PO-2 remains in *approved* state and can be issued once the quote and budget are confirmed, or cancelled if the requirement is dropped.\n\nOne minor note: the Storage quote is stated as tax- and delivery-inclusive, so the $560.00 commitment should be the full landed cost for that line.",
